@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

User -> System: opens the main menu
System --> User: shows the Recent box with the last scanned album\nor informs that there are none

opt there are recent scans
  User -> System: expands the Recent box
  System --> User: shows the last 10 scanned albums

  User -> System: collapses the Recent box
  System --> User: shows only the last scanned album

  User -> System: selects an album
  System --> User: shows the album details
end

@enduml
